OL,3,ABus and train collide on French side of
OL,4,AChannel Tunnel with at least 19 hurt
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 19 people are injured
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash between a freight
OL,8,Ftrain and a bus at the entrance to the
OL,9,FChannel Tunnel in France
OL,11,FLocal officials in Pas-de-Calais say
OL,12,Fthe incident occurred where vehicles
OL,13,Fwere boarding the Le Shuttle at the
OL,14,Floading platform for the Eurotunnel
OL,16,FNo deaths have been reported and no
OL,17,Flives are in danger, officials say
OL,19,FEmergency services are at the scene,
OL,20,Fwith authorities set to provide an
OL,21,Fupdate later tonight
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
